OL,4,BPant joins New Zealand club match      
OL,5,Bunder false name                       
OL,6,GIndia wicketkeeper Rishabh Pant made a 
OL,7,Gsurprise appearance for a club team in 
OL,8,GChristchurch under the false name      
OL,9,G'Stan Stan'.                           
OL,11,FPant, 29, played for the Open House    
OL,12,FSwingers against The Chosen Ones and   
OL,13,Fsmashed 54 from 21 balls in a 16-run   
OL,14,Fwin.                                   
OL,16,FHis appearance came a day before       
OL,17,FIndia's second Test against New        
OL,18,FZealand, which begins at the Hagley    
OL,19,FOval at 22:00 GMT on Thursday.         
